The use of cis-platin can cause side effects so carboplatin has been developed.

Carboplatin can be synthesised from cis-platin, $\text{Pt}(\text{NH}_3)_2\text{Cl}_2$, by replacing the two chloride ion ligands with a single cyclobutane-1,1-dicarboxylate ion ligand as shown.

{{figure:pdf_visual_03.png}}
